                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "鬼畜大冒险 Gui Chu Da Mao Xian is simply the best game to exist on the Steam Platform. It has a wonderfully well made interface that manages to keep you immersed in the game without giving too much attention to the technical details, and of course is absolutely beautiful with gameplay. This game will immerse you in it's beautiful round-a-bout turn based combat. The mechanics simply cannot be challenged by the slacking RPG Makers of the past and future. 鬼畜大冒险 Gui Chu Da Mao Xian easily overtakes the 3D fighting games, novels and loads of trash that surround this holy grail of an experience. Anyone who disagrees with the amount of gameplay, techniques, playstyles and options may be simply biased or brainwashed. I can most certainly say that this games graphics challenges even reality itself, as Virtual Reality, other animation, 2D and 3D games do not compare to the masterpiece known as 鬼畜大冒险 Gui Chu Da Mao Xian. This game has been a major contribution to my awakening and realization of the meaning of life. This game is an immediate eye-opening godsend that should be studied for future generations until death do us part. The story arcs, character designs, and character development put in by the developers is quite literally an amazing feat by humanity. This game has been turned into an instant classic, and will pave the way for the development of not just games, but technology and social values as a whole. The game is a must play, and must be researched and developed for better, more amazing technological advancements for the universe.\n",
